('original:fine-arts--art-history--renaissance-art:fine-arts--art-history--renaissance-art--1',1,'{"question":"What does ''Renaissance'' mean in the context of European art history?","choices":["A period of renewed interest in classical learning and new artistic approaches","A movement rejecting all observation","A period defined by digital media","A single style used identically across Europe"],"answer":0,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'11a4a722ea99cc2d1455586e0a6ba6ad','official',NULL,NULL,'Renaissance Art'),
