('original:fine-arts--dance--choreography-basics:fine-arts--dance--choreography-basics--7',1,'{"question":"A dance moves from a solo to a group formation. What compositional element changes?","choices":["The audience''s location","The music''s recording format","Number of performers and spatial relationship","The costume fabric"],"answer":2,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'969ceaf0fa9414cf83ff3c943a2f3d7c','official',NULL,NULL,'Choreography Basics'),
